{"id":1981,"level":80,"name":"Центр (2)","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);'>The center of the board remains the core of every chess game. Whoever controls the center often has a better position and can attack more easily. By bringing your pieces and pawns to the center, you build a flexible and strong position to pressure your opponent.</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"rnb1kb1r/pp1p1pp1/1q2pn1p/2pP4/8/2N5/PPPBPPPP/R2QKBNR w KQkq - 0 6","pgn":"{[%evp 0,1,45,69]} 6. e4 * ","text":"<p>Просуваючи пішака електронних шахів, білі посилюють центр і відкривають діагональ для слона.</p><p><br></p>","format":27},{"fen":"r1bqkb1r/pp2pppp/2n2n2/8/2P5/5N2/PP1P1PPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 0 5","pgn":"{[%evp 0,1,-65,-73]} 5... e5 * ","text":"<p>Розмістивши пішака в центрі, чорні зміцнюють контроль над критичним полем шахівниці на d4. Крім того, чорні готують розвиток слона.</p><p><br></p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":76291,"fen":"rn1qk2r/pp2ppbp/2p2np1/3b2N1/2pP4/N5P1/PP2PPBP/R1BQ1RK1 w kq - 0 9","pgn":"{[%csl Rd5][%evp 0,1,58,120]} {Q=1} 9. e4 * ","format":27,"texts":["Взяти контроль над центром."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":76296,"fen":"3r1r2/p5bk/3pB1pp/1q2p3/5p2/8/PP3PPP/2RQR1K1 b - - 0 22","pgn":"{[%csl Yd5][%evp 0,1,-114,-133]} {Q=1} 22... d5 * ","format":27,"texts":["Increase your control of the center."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":76292,"fen":"rnbq1rk1/p1ppbppp/1p2pn2/8/2PP1B2/2N2N2/PP2PPPP/R2QKB1R w KQ - 0 6","pgn":"{[%csl Ye4][%evp 0,1,48,39]} {Q=1} 6. e4 * ","format":27,"texts":["Взяти контроль над центром."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":76309,"fen":"r1bqk2r/pppp1ppp/5n2/4n3/4P3/P1N5/1PPP1KPP/R1BQ1B1R w kq - 0 7","pgn":"{[%csl Re5][%evp 0,1,123,152]} {Q=1} 7. d4 * ","format":27,"texts":["Improve your center control."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":76293,"fen":"r1bq1b1r/pppp1kpp/2n5/4p3/4N3/5N2/PPP